    "title": "Laredo man arrested in 2019 felony theft case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juan Puente ,\n1 days ago LAREDO, Tex. (KGNS) - A former Laredo bartender was arrested on theft charges from a 2019 investigation into fraud at a local nightclub. On October 19, 36-year-old Daniel Avila Jr. was served with an arrest warrant for a state-jail felony theft charge. The warrant was originally approved on July 22, 2020, but police were unable to locate Avila at that time. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
